usage: tool [-h] [-v] [-o PATH] [--mode {fast,slow}] [--tag TAGS]
            [--limit LIMIT] [--ratio RATIO] [--dry-run] [--color | --no-color]
            [--pair A B] [--opt [OPT]] [--json | --csv] [--threads THREADS]
            [files ...]

Process some files. This description is long enough to wrap over more than one
line of help.

positional arguments:
  files                input files

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  -v, --verbose        more output
  -o, --output PATH    where to write
  --mode {fast,slow}   speed (default: fast)
  --tag TAGS
  --limit LIMIT
  --ratio RATIO
  --dry-run
  --color, --no-color
  --pair A B
  --opt [OPT]
  --json
  --csv

advanced:
  knobs for experts

  --threads THREADS

See the docs.

